{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=4891320&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-13T22:48:45Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"4891320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "[WoG] War of Genesis: Idle Loot", "steam_appid": 4891320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A personal mini-battlefield right on your desktop.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clunky game windows, no cluttered background maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of Genesis: Idle Loot is an idle loot RPG with a transparent background that runs smoothly in a small corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D hero sets up camp on your desktop, battling tirelessly by your side no matter what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><u>Just leave it running, and it gets stronger on its own.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No controls required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or sleeping, your hero's growth never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Trade acquired loot on the Steam Community Market.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items you loot can be traded with other players on the Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of trading your hard-earned spoils and filling up your Steam Wallet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The real fun is in the loot drops.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you run stages, gear pours in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, armor, and even gems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own powerful setup through endless item farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Join an Alliance and grow together.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with alliance members to tackle powerful bosses in Alliance Raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer action with players worldwide.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge global players in World Boss battles, test your hero's might in the PvP Arena, and chat with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your hero grow automatically, trade looted gear on the Market, and compete with players across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of Genesis: Idle Loot. Right now, on your desktop.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A personal mini-battlefield right on your desktop.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clunky game windows, no cluttered background maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of Genesis: Idle Loot is an idle loot RPG with a transparent background that runs smoothly in a small corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D hero sets up camp on your desktop, battling tirelessly by your side no matter what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><u>Just leave it running, and it gets stronger on its own.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No controls required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or sleeping, your hero's growth never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Trade acquired loot on the Steam Community Market.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items you loot can be traded with other players on the Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of trading your hard-earned spoils and filling up your Steam Wallet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The real fun is in the loot drops.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you run stages, gear pours in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, armor, and even gems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own powerful setup through endless item farmi